<p>Achilles&#8217; shield is <a href="https://sourcebooks.web.fordham.edu/ancient/Homer-shieldofachilles.asp">described so well</a> in the <em>Iliad</em> that artists have been recreating it ever since.</p>
<p>This version was drawn by French architectural theorist Quatremère de Quincy in 1814.</p>
